cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AP_Load2026, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "AP_Load2026: reference implementations of the Antipsychotic Dose Load"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementations, in Python, R, SPSS and JavaScript, of the
  Antipsychotic Dose Load (AP_Load2026): a normalised prescribed-dose index in
  which each antipsychotic is scored as its prescribed daily dose expressed as a
  percentage of a documented reference dose, summed across agents without an
  upper cap. Includes the complete dated reference tables.
